---

<section id="specs" class="py-16 sm:py-24 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto border-t border-slate-200 scroll-mt-20">
  <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16 space-y-4">
    <span class="font-['Space_Grotesk',monospace] text-xs font-semibold px-3.5 py-1.5 bg-slate-900 text-white inline-block rounded-none uppercase">
      TECNOLOGIA DE PONTA
    </span>
    <!-- Title in perfect agreement with Header Menu: Tecnologia Memjet & Laser -->
    <h2 class="font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans',sans-serif] text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
      Tecnologia Memjet & Laser
    </h2>
    <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed font-['Space_Grotesk',monospace]">
      Especificações técnicas, módulos industriais e sistemas de impressão e corte digital projetados para máxima eficiência operacional, precisão micrométrica e durabilidade certificada.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-stretch">
    <!-- Left Technical Parameters Card (Square) -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-5 bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between space-y-6 rounded-none">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6 pb-4 border-b border-slate-100">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-2xl text-[#00aeef]">tune</span>
          <h3 class="font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans',sans-serif] text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 uppercase">PARÂMETROS TÉCNICOS</h3>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4 font-['Space_Grotesk',monospace] text-xs">
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:justify-between sm:items-center gap-1 py-2 border-b border-slate-100">
            <span class="text-slate-500 font-medium">SUBSTRATO MÁXIMO</span>
            <span class="font-bold text-slate-900 bg-slate-100 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-none">350 GSM ARCHIVAL</span>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:justify-between sm:items-center gap-1 py-2 border-b border-slate-100">
            <span class="text-slate-500 font-medium">GAMA DE COR</span>
            <span class="font-bold text-[#00aeef] bg-[#00aeef]/10 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-none">CMYK ALTA DENSIDADE</span>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:justify-between sm:items-center gap-1 py-2 border-b border-slate-100">
            <span class="text-slate-500 font-medium">SISTEMA DE SECAGEM</span>
            <span class="font-bold text-[#e11d48] bg-rose-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-none">NIR & DUAL UV LED</span>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:justify-between sm:items-center gap-1 py-2 border-b border-slate-100">
            <span class="text-slate-500 font-medium">MESA DE VÁCUO</span>
            <span class="font-bold text-[#f59e0b] bg-amber-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-none">MULTIZONA SERVO</span>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:justify-between sm:items-center gap-1 py-2 border-b border-slate-100">
            <span class="text-slate-500 font-medium">TECNOLOGIA DE CABEÇOTE</span>
            <span class="font-bold text-slate-900 bg-slate-100 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-none">MEMJET DURAFLEX®</span>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:justify-between sm:items-center gap-1 py-2 border-b border-slate-100">
            <span class="text-slate-500 font-medium">FONTE DE CORTE A LASER</span>
            <span class="font-bold text-[#00aeef] bg-sky-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-none">CO2 RF 150W - 350W</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Notice Banner (Square) -->
      <div class="p-4 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 text-xs font-['Space_Grotesk',monospace] text-slate-600 rounded-none">
        <span class="font-bold text-slate-900 block mb-1">Garantia & Suporte Especializado Katun [+]</span>
        <span>Todos os equipamentos Katun DPS contam com certificação de calibração óptica, estoque local de peças e suporte técnico especializado no Brasil e América Latina.</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Right 2 Module Visual Cards (Real Photos) -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-7 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <!-- Laser Cut Module (Real Taurus 35 PL Plus Laser Photo!) -->
      <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow group flex flex-col justify-between rounded-none">
        <div class="relative h-56 overflow-hidden bg-slate-50 rounded-none p-2">
          <img 
            src="/imagenes/CATALOGO_IMAGENES_WEB/02_Cortadoras_y_Finalizadoras/06_Taurus_35_PL_Plus_Laser_CO2/taurus-35-pl-plus-laser-co2-principal.webp" 
            alt="Módulo de corte a laser CO2 Taurus 35 PL Plus" 
            class="w-full h-full object-contain group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
          />
          <span class="absolute top-3 left-3 bg-[#e11d48] text-white text-[11px] font-['Space_Grotesk',monospace] font-bold px-3 py-1 shadow-sm rounded-none uppercase">
            CORTE A LASER CO2
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 space-y-2">
          <h4 class="font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans',sans-serif] text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">
            Troquelagem a Laser Galvanométrico
          </h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-['Space_Grotesk',monospace]">
            Unidade óptica de corte digital com velocidade de até 70 m/min. Elimina matrizes mecânicas e permite trocar de desenho instantaneamente via leitura contínua de código QR.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CMYK Injection V2 (Real ArrowJet Aqua 330R Memjet Photo!) -->
      <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow group flex flex-col justify-between rounded-none">
        <div class="relative h-56 overflow-hidden bg-slate-50 rounded-none p-2">
          <img 
            src="/imagenes/CATALOGO_IMAGENES_WEB/01_Impresoras_Digitales/03_ArrowJet_Aqua_330R/arrowjet-aqua-330r-principal-2025.webp" 
            alt="Microinjeção CMYK Memjet DuraFlex" 
            class="w-full h-full object-contain group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
          />
          <span class="absolute top-3 left-3 bg-[#00aeef] text-white text-[11px] font-['Space_Grotesk',monospace] font-bold px-3 py-1 shadow-sm rounded-none uppercase">
            MEMJET® DURAFLEX®
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 space-y-2">
          <h4 class="font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans',sans-serif] text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">
            Microinjeção CMYK Single Pass
          </h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-['Space_Grotesk',monospace]">
            Injeção contínua a 120 kHz com gotas fixas de 1,2 picolitros a 1600x1600 DPI. Nitidez cirúrgica em textos pequenos de 3pt, traços finos e códigos de barras de alta densidade.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
